Changes include a unified Rust CLI background service, same-user control socket,
GNOME Shell status ring, Rust GTK4 file/device/text selector, Nautilus menu,
transactional verified CLI receive files, receive session cleanup, user-local
installer and desktop release/test tooling. See CHANGELOG.desktop.md and Git
history for details. These modifications are not an official LocalSend release.

